ass=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"h-px w-5 bg-signal\"></i><p class=\"\">Surprise Intelligence · a model of forecast fragility</p></div><h1 class=\"\">Is this agreement<br/><em class=\"font-normal\">earned or fragile?</em></h1><p class=\"\">When many forecasts agree, Zeno checks whether that agreement is earned or fragile. It never changes your forecast without proof, and always says why: trust, widen, adjust or look again.</p><div class=\"\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/check\">Try Zeno Check</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/agents\">Connect</a></div></div><div class=\"\"><figure class=\"hero-instrument\" aria-label=\"Sydney temperature, 5 ensemble models: the forecasts, Zeno&#x27;s answer, and what actually happened\"><figcaption class=\"\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"\">Real case · <!-- -->Weather<!-- --> · <!-- -->24 hours ahead</p><p class=\"\" title=\"Sydney temperature, 5 ensemble models\">Sydney temperature, 5 ensemble models</p></div><span class=\"\">adjusted</span></figcaption><div class=\"relative mt-8\"><div class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><div class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"hero-actual-line\" style=\"\"><span>actual <!-- -->22.2°</span></div></div><span></span></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"hero-range-row\" style=\"animation-delay:100ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">ECMWF</span><div class=\"relative h-4\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span><i class=\"\" style=\"left:9.999999999999993%\"></i></div><span class=\"\">21.2°<!-- --> · 88% risk<!-- --> · held</span></div></div><div class=\"hero-range-row\" style=\"animation-delay:190ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">GEM</span><div class=\"relative h-4\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span><i class=\"\" style=\"\"></i></div><span class=\"\">26.5°<!-- --> · missed</span></div></div><div class=\"hero-range-row\" style=\"animation-delay:280ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">ICON</span><div class=\"relative h-4\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span><i class=\"\" style=\"left:75%\"></i></div><span class=\"\">29.0°<!-- --> · missed</span></div></div><div class=\"hero-range-row\" style=\"animation-delay:370ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">NCEP</span><div class=\"relative h-4\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span><i class=\"\" style=\"\"></i></div><span class=\"\">21.6°<!-- --> · held</span></div></div><div class=\"hero-range-row\" style=\"animation-delay:460ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">UKMO</span><div class=\"relative h-4\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span><i class=\"\" style=\"left:60%\"></i></div><span class=\"\">27.2°<!-- --> · 66% risk<!-- --> · missed</span></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"animation-delay:620ms\"><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">ZENO</span><div class=\"relative h-5\"><span class=\"\" style=\"\"></span></div><span class=\"\">90% range</span></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><span></span><div class=\"relative h-3\"><span class=\"\" style=\"left:0%\">20.0°</span><span class=\"\" style=\"left:33.33333333333333%\">24.0°</span><span class=\"\" style=\"left:66.66666666666666%\">28.0°</span><span class=\"\" style=\"left:100%\">32.0°</span></div><span></span></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"py-3 pr-3\"><p class=\"\">forecasts</p><p class=\"\">26.5°</p></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"\">Zeno</p><p class=\"\">25.1°</p></div><div class=\"py-3 pl-3\"><p class=\"\">actual</p><p class=\"\">22.2°</p></div></div><p class=\"\">Zeno flagged the two confident models most likely to miss. One did miss, and one held. Zeno moved toward the answer.</p><div class=\"\"><div class=\"flex gap-1\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose an example\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"\">Weather</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"\">Crypto</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"\">Prediction market</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"\">next →</button></div></figure><div class=\"mt-4\"><div><button class=\"\">Run the Sydney case on the live model</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"\"><div class=\"ed-shell\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"\">01 · why it matters</p><h2 class=\"\">Confident forecasts fail without warning.</h2><p class=\"\">Every forecast says how sure it is; Zeno learns which forecasters fail together, then must prove that knowing this improves decisions. Here is one real case, start to finish.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 md:mt-16\"><div><ol class=\"\"><li class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Forecasts arrive</p><p class=\"\">26.5°</p><p class=\"\">5 weather models forecast Sydney&#x27;s temperature 24 hours ahead. Their middle answer is 26.5°.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Zeno reads track records</p><p class=\"\">2 flagged</p><p class=\"\">ECMWF 88% · UKMO 66% chance of a confident miss, based on how each model has failed before.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Zeno answers</p><p class=\"\">25.1°</p><p class=\"\">An adjusted forecast with a 90% range of 21.1–29.1°, plus the reason for each flag.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">04<!-- --> · <!-- -->What happened</p><p class=\"\">22.2°</p><p class=\"\">The panel was off by 4.3°; Zeno by 2.9°. Zeno&#x27;s range held. Of the flagged models, UKMO missed; ECMWF held — a false alarm, shown too.</p></li></ol><div class=\"\"><span class=\"\">one frozen example · not an average</span><span class=\"\">warnings measured on ensemble weather only</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"\"><div class=\"ed-shell\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"\">02 · how it works</p><h2 class=\"\">It learns when confidence is earned.</h2><p class=\"\">Zeno remembers how each model has failed before. It adjusts only where that memory has been proven on later weeks, and otherwise keeps your forecast.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 md:mt-16\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">In</p><p class=\"\">Your forecasts</p><p class=\"\">any models, with or without ranges</p></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">Memory</p><p class=\"\">Their track record</p><p class=\"\">only outcomes known before the decision</p></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"label-mono\">Gate</p><p class=\"\">Has Zeno earned it here?</p><p class=\"\">tested on later weeks it never saw</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><p class=\"label-mono text-signal\">yes · adjust</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">Adjusted forecast, 90% range and miss risk per model.</p></div><div class=\"bg-background p-5\"><p class=\"label-mono\">no · keep yours</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">Your forecast returned unchanged, with the reason.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"\"><div class=\"ed-shell\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"md:col-span-8\"><p class=\"\">03 · what Zeno caught</p><h2 class=\"\">Real warnings, real misses, false alarms too.</h2><p class=\"\">Sealed weeks the model never saw. Every case is shown with what really happened.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 md:mt-16\"><div class=\"space-y-10\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"62 of 100 alerts were real confident misses\"><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span 